# CSA CLI Audit Report - Brain CLI

```yaml
header:
  id: CSA_CLI_AUDIT_20260604
  intent: AUDIT
  status: DRAFT
  scope: cli_ecosystem
```

## RR CLI DNA Analysis

```yaml
rr_cli:
  traits:
    - CommandModule: trait with namespace() and handle()
  structs:
    - CliCommand: { family: CommandFamily, action: str, raw: str }
    - ParsedCommandHead: { style: CommandStyle, head: str, tail: str, left: Option<str>, right: Option<str> }
    - CommandFamily: enum { Intent, Rfn, Cap, Ape, Rc, Evidence, Helio }
    - CommandStyle: enum { Artisan, Git, Domain, Unknown }
  functions:
    - parse_family: str -> Option<CommandFamily>
    - is_known_family: str -> bool
    - is_known_command: (family: str, action: str) -> bool
    - parse_command_head: str -> ParsedCommandHead
    - detect_style: (head: str, tail: str) -> CommandStyle
    - split_on: (raw: str, sep: char) -> Option<(str, str)>
  pattern:
    - no_std compliant
    - no runtime dependencies
    - pure parsing logic
```

## Hace CLI Analysis

```yaml
hace_cli:
  extends: rr_cli
  adds:
    - CommandModule Implementation
    - ModuleRegistry pattern
    - IR (Intermediate Representation) flow
  structure:
    - cmd::amo: AmoModule
    - cmd::brain: BrainModule
    - cmd::comet: CometModule
    - cmd::force: ForceModule
    - cmd::serve: ServeModule
    - cmd::hot: HotModule
    - cmd::audit: AuditModule
  dispatcher:
    - Registry: HashMap<String, Box<dyn CommandModule>>
    - gate_via_me: CLIE validation hook
    - build_raw_command: IR -> String
```

## Hace ME CLIE Analysis

```yaml
hace_me_clie:
  traits:
    - Clie: Parser interface
  structs:
    - ParseInput: { raw_command: str, actor_id: str, authority_level: AuthorityLevel, ... }
    - ParseOutput: { parsed_command: str, validation: ValidationResult, ... }
  flow:
    - CLI input -> ParseInput -> Clie.parse() -> ParseOutput
    - validation_result determines if command proceeds
```

## Brain CLI Gap Analysis

```yaml
brain_cli_gap:
  implemented:
    - lib.rs: core module structure
    - command.rs: BrainAction enum
    - router.rs: BrainRouter
    - executor.rs: BrainExecutor, ModelExecutor, LoraExecutor, ReplayExecutor
    - model.rs, lora.rs, replay.rs, inspect.rs, profile.rs, benchmark.rs
  missing:
    - Integration with Hace CLI dispatcher
    - Wire to BrainRuntime
    - Real model loading integration
    - KV cache inspection
    - Golden tensor replay
```

